      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's still happening though. we tried a dehumidifier and we're being super careful with the paper, but these patches just keep appearing. it almost feels like something is actually interfering with the ink during the press, like the color is just being taken away as soon as the heat hits it. any other technical reasons for why color would just vanish like that?",
